Build OpenCode CLI 产物依赖 opencode 的 workspace 依赖包；此前 paths 只覆盖 packages/opencode，导致 core 等依赖包变更不会触发 CLI 构建。

补充 core/plugin/script/sdk/ui 路径，保持触发范围克制，只覆盖会影响 CLI binary 的 workspace 依赖，避免无关文档或应用改动触发发布构建。

diff --git a/.github/workflows/build-opencode.yml b/.github/workflows/build-opencode.yml
index cc0db1c729f8e97b9db0b703097cb864217c7b1c..7d2033970c13424dcd506564f41a5d86224d75d2 100644
--- a/.github/workflows/build-opencode.yml
+++ b/.github/workflows/build-opencode.yml
@@ -14,6 +14,11 @@ on:
       - ".github/workflows/build-opencode.yml"
       - ".github/actions/setup-bun/action.yml"
       - "packages/opencode/**"
+      - "packages/core/**"
+      - "packages/plugin/**"
+      - "packages/script/**"
+      - "packages/sdk/js/**"
+      - "packages/ui/**"
       - "package.json"
       - "bun.lock"
       - "install"
